==Trivia==
*While Cooking, Link will hum various [[Song]]s.
**In {{TotK}}, these songs include "[[Saria's Song]]" and "[[Kass's Theme]]".
*During development of {{TP}}, [[Eiji Aonuma]] had the idea of adding Cooking into a game. However, it was never implemented prior to {{BotW|-}} as he could not find a way to make it fun and exciting.<ref>{{Cite Person|quote= To tell you the truth, I've been thinking for a long time about how I could work cooking into a game somehow. But the fact of the matter is that cooking, when you stop to think about it, is pretty boring. It's really slow work and there's not a lot you can really do to make it seem very exciting. [...] So maybe if, going forward, I can find a way to make cooking seem more exciting and allow people to have fun with it, I would probably try to put it into a game. Maybe if at some point down the road there is cooking in a game, you guys can all look back and say, "Hey. I bet Aonuma did this."|name= Eiji Aonuma|url= https://web.archive.org/web/20100224055215/uk.cube.ign.com/articles/517/517033p1.html|title= The Legend of Zelda producer talks about the game, the franchise, the past and the future.}}</ref>

